  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "1501201",
      "subQuestName": "Ask about Imix's situation",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150120101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150120101": {
            "id": "150120101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "Sh—She's not back yet... I hope nothing bad happened to Master Cheven...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120102"
            ]
          },
          "150120102": {
            "id": "150120102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, that little kid is crying. Wonder what happened...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120103"
            ]
          },
          "150120103": {
            "id": "150120103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's go check what's wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120104"
            ]
          },
          "150120104": {
            "id": "150120104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hello. Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120105"
            ]
          },
          "150120105": {
            "id": "150120105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "*sobs* M—Master Cheven, she...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120106"
            ]
          },
          "150120106": {
            "id": "150120106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "Sh—She went to gather Volcanic Crystals... But, she's still not back yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120107"
            ]
          },
          "150120107": {
            "id": "150120107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "I told the guards, but they said that they don't have people to spare. Plus, that area's super dangerous, with tons of monsters and bad guys...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120108"
            ]
          },
          "150120108": {
            "id": "150120108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "They have to finish making preparations before they can try to rescue her... But, it'll be too late by then!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120111"
            ]
          },
          "150120111": {
            "id": "150120111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "So, you'll help? Great! I'll just make a quick sketch to show you where the guards went earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120112"
            ]
          },
          "150120112": {
            "id": "150120112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "They said Master Cheven might have stopped around here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120113"
            ]
          },
          "150120113": {
            "id": "150120113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "She might have been forced to go near the Shadow Pin. If that's the case... Then... *sniffles*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120114"
            ]
          },
          "150120114": {
            "id": "150120114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "Please! You have to save her!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501202",
      "subQuestName": "Go rescue Cheven",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150120201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150120201": {
            "id": "150120201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Imix",
            "text": "Please help me save Master Cheven!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501203",
      "subQuestName": "Save Cheven",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501204",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Cheven",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150120701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150120701": {
            "id": "150120701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why did she stop?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120702"
            ]
          },
          "150120702": {
            "id": "150120702",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "...Because of her daughter. Poor Nechca contracted an awful illness and Tlazolli put everything aside to take care of her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120703"
            ]
          },
          "150120703": {
            "id": "150120703",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Even as Nechca's illness grew worse, Tlazolli never gave up. Like a torch in the night, she was determined to burn bright, even as darkness encroached from all directions...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120704"
            ]
          },
          "150120704": {
            "id": "150120704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Still, all's well that ends well! Thanks to the doctor's medicine and the Great Spirit's protection, Nechca's flame was rekindled!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120705"
            ]
          },
          "150120705": {
            "id": "150120705",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Her condition has been slowly improving ever since. She's still weak, of course, and has to recuperate at home... but she's well enough to write letters already.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120706"
            ]
          },
          "150120706": {
            "id": "150120706",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "She often writes to Xilonen, apparently. Her dream is to become an Ancient Names forger, just like her mother.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120707"
            ]
          },
          "150120707": {
            "id": "150120707",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Her birthday's in a few days, so Tlazolli asked me to find a pure Volcanic Crystal to give her as a present.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120710"
            ]
          },
          "150120710": {
            "id": "150120710",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, talk about an important chunk of ore! What a nice gift! Paimon hopes it helps her feel better!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120711"
            ]
          },
          "150120711": {
            "id": "150120711",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "I'm sure she and her mother appreciate your well wishes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120712"
            ]
          },
          "150120712": {
            "id": "150120712",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Alright, let's head back. I'm sure Imix is worried sick.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120713"
            ]
          },
          "150120713": {
            "id": "150120713",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Actually, why don't you come with me to visit Tlazolli tomorrow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120714"
            ]
          },
          "150120714": {
            "id": "150120714",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "It's all thanks to you that I managed to bring back the crystal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120715"
            ]
          },
          "150120715": {
            "id": "150120715",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "You deserve a reward for helping us protect something so significant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120716"
            ]
          },
          "150120716": {
            "id": "150120716",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I just hope it makes Nechca happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120717"
            ]
          },
          "150120717": {
            "id": "150120717",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right. A good mood makes for a quick recovery!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120718"
            ]
          },
          "150120718": {
            "id": "150120718",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And of course, we, uh... wouldn't say no to a little gift...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120719"
            ]
          },
          "150120719": {
            "id": "150120719",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Haha, don't worry. Something tells me you'll like this one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120720"
            ]
          },
          "150120720": {
            "id": "150120720",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "But, I'll let Tlazolli tell you what it is herself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501204",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150120401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150120401": {
            "id": "150120401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, they didn't put up much of a fight...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120404"
            ]
          },
          "150120404": {
            "id": "150120404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Phew... Thank you so much... I thought I wasn't gonna make it down this mountain alive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120405"
            ]
          },
          "150120405": {
            "id": "150120405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "#Saved by {NICKNAME}... Guess my luck's not too bad today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120406"
            ]
          },
          "150120406": {
            "id": "150120406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Ah, sorry, let me introduce myself. I'm Cheven, a gem artisan. I'm not usually this lucky, but maybe things are looking up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120407"
            ]
          },
          "150120407": {
            "id": "150120407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Imix sent us to help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120408"
            ]
          },
          "150120408": {
            "id": "150120408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "She did, huh... *sigh* I didn't mean to make her worry. I wasn't planning to be gone longer than two days tops.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120409"
            ]
          },
          "150120409": {
            "id": "150120409",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "But, then, I discovered a new seam of Volcanic Crystal near the Shadow Pin... It's a large deposit, and the purity is exceptional.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120410"
            ]
          },
          "150120410": {
            "id": "150120410",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "I dug up a whole bunch of it and was getting ready to head back, but the phlogiston within the crystals attracted monsters..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501205",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150120501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150120501": {
            "id": "150120501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "I panicked, and ran up a narrow path to avoid them... But, by the time I was in the clear, I ended up running into those bandits... You showed up in the nick of time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120502"
            ]
          },
          "150120502": {
            "id": "150120502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If the situation was so dangerous, why didn't you just drop the crystals and run?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120503"
            ]
          },
          "150120503": {
            "id": "150120503",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "I left most of them behind, believe me. I only kept the purest chunk — I have to bring it back, no matter what.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120504"
            ]
          },
          "150120504": {
            "id": "150120504",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "...For Tlazolli, and poor little Nechca.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120505"
            ]
          },
          "150120505": {
            "id": "150120505",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Who are they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120506"
            ]
          },
          "150120506": {
            "id": "150120506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Ah, right, you wouldn't know. Tlazolli is a former Ancient Name artisan, and Nechca is her daughter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1501206",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150120601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150120601": {
            "id": "150120601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Anyway... I'm sure you've seen the state this place is in. It's all because the Shadow Pin suddenly came crashing to the ground and left behind a massive crater.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120602"
            ]
          },
          "150120602": {
            "id": "150120602",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "The seam I found was closer to the outside, so it survived the disaster. Still, the crash riled up the monsters in the area, and now they're everywhere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120603"
            ]
          },
          "150120603": {
            "id": "150120603",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "I panicked, and ran up a narrow path to avoid them... But, by the time I was in the clear, I ended up running into those bandits... You showed up in the nick of time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120604"
            ]
          },
          "150120604": {
            "id": "150120604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If the situation was so dangerous, why didn't you just drop the crystals and run?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120605"
            ]
          },
          "150120605": {
            "id": "150120605",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "I left most of them behind, believe me. I only kept the purest chunk — I have to bring it back, no matter what.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120606"
            ]
          },
          "150120606": {
            "id": "150120606",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "...For Tlazolli, and poor little Nechca.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120607"
            ]
          },
          "150120607": {
            "id": "150120607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Who are they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150120608"
            ]
          },
          "150120608": {
            "id": "150120608",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Cheven",
            "text": "Ah, right, you wouldn't know. Tlazolli is a former Ancient Name artisan, and Nechca is her daughter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
